// ANCHOR: migrate
$ sspur deploy migrate notes_v1.ssp notes_v2.ssp --out mig
migrate svc notes #1d67e631ca7fd732 -> #7cd30b84fad22a9a
  Notes migration schema ltijs64nicnc -> 2rjv4w4gfn3f via migrate_Notes, reverse unmigrate_Notes
    ! field tags: List[Str] added (required)
    note: writes keep a v_ltijs64nicnc copy made by unmigrate_Notes, so the old version reads new items
  backfill: backfill_Notes (dynamodb:Scan, dynamodb:PutItem on Notes); reads migrate lazily until it has run
  ok: old and new versions can run side by side
// ANCHOR_END: migrate
